  "limitation_9_gene_gene_correlation": "The manuscript's size-matched null permutes GENES, so it cannot see gene-gene correlation and is anti-conservative for coherent sets -- a screen, not a test. The label permutation here permutes SAMPLES and never resamples the gene set, so the correlation structure is preserved exactly. Where the arms are small enough the enumeration is COMPLETE and the p is exact.",
